{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've gone into the darkness willingly, so here's what to expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the game mechanics will make sense \u2014 you avoid or confront enemies, solve puzzles, absorb the environmental storytelling and horrific atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as you descend into the depths, so too do you descend into madness. The once-cozy confinement of a crumbling Egyptian tomb transforms into a nightmarish maze of weeping forests, claustrophobic sewers, and rusted industrial complexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gods want entertainment, tugging at you from all angles, seeing how long until you break. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters may wish to be your friends \u2014 if your reputation is high enough. Walls are merely a suggestion. Death is a ladder to a nonsensical suburban town filled with anxious, skinless creatures. If you flush the toilet 4 times, you might get poisoned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember, most of all: <br><strong>Revel in fear.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2378250?t=1760367776","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2378250?t=1760367776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378250/b1729e3218b9a80be7e0026f7f018da2063943d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760367776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378250/b1729e3218b9a80be7e0026f7f018da2063943d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760367776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've gone into the darkness willingly, so here's what to expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the game mechanics will make sense \u2014 you avoid or confront enemies, solve puzzles, absorb the environmental storytelling and horrific atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as you descend into the depths, so too do you descend into madness. The once-cozy confinement of a crumbling Egyptian tomb transforms into a nightmarish maze of weeping forests, claustrophobic sewers, and rusted industrial complexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gods want entertainment, tugging at you from all angles, seeing how long until you break. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters may wish to be your friends \u2014 if your reputation is high enough. Walls are merely a suggestion. Death is a ladder to a nonsensical suburban town filled with anxious, skinless creatures. If you flush the toilet 4 times, you might get poisoned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember, most of all: <br><strong>Revel in fear.</strong></p>","developers":["Aleksandar \u0110uri\u010di\u0107"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378250/03eb811391ec2307e262939a56e2e95738964e48/header.jpg?t=1760367776","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04, and CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+, Vulkan capable.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, x64 architecture with SSE2.<br></li><li><s